{"id": "周興哲 想念你想我 (live)", "source_audio": {"audio_sha1": "876aa2854e", "audio_seconds": 284.459, "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l7ZKHrPIkMQ"}, "why": "Live concert recording: crowd noise, ad-libs, and an arrangement that differs from the studio cut.", "language": "zh", "sheet": [{"time": 12.91, "text": "城市闪动  如风环抱雨的温柔", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 18.94, "text": "爱笑的你  总是先把快乐给我", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 25.77, "text": "时间幽默  不怪谁  破坏承诺", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 33.27, "text": "是相遇  太早  才错过", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 40.45, "text": "搁浅日落  晒红的脸言不由衷", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 45.94, "text": "顽固的我  总会想到很远以后", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 53.21, "text": "任性地走  像星体公转一周", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 60.57, "text": "我转身  你不在身后", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 67.68, "text": "失去你  好不真实", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 74.06, "text": "伤害了爱  却还  奢望  重新开始", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 80.9, "text": "有一种挥霍  迟来  懂谁爱我", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 87.8, "text": "你不在  原来生命  就是漂泊", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 94.38, "text": "想念你  如此真实", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 101.06, "text": "相信的人  坚持  分开  谁能解释", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 108.45, "text": "不怕你幸福  就怕你  忘了我", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 115.24, "text": "心会痛  是最好的  不再拥有", "end": 0.0, "confidence": 0.0, "anchored": false, "words": []}, {"time": 12